able to write certain stories. Recently, a newspaper published an article"},{"text":"criticising the latest environmental policies. If they hadn't published it,","w":0.40444442749023435,"x":0.55111112363266057,"y":0.73387755085555184,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.013386585469148504,"w":0.34699264526367191,"text":"12knew \/ wouldn't know so much about the problem now.","y":0.74747595715760684,"x":0.54872974597241753},{"w":0.41555553436279291,"x":0.55111112586304789,"y":0.76308139553511367,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"• Freedom of the press is fine as long as they don't encourage violence"},{"text":"or crime. After an article about graffiti appeared in the local paper, some","x":0.55111110637255867,"w":0.41777778625488282,"y":0.77755102049919755,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.54888888802449576,"y":0.79215116307744327,"w":0.43333332061767571,"h":0.010297816529565851,"text":"teenagers here decided to try it. They wouldn't have done that 3provided \/"},{"y":0.80523255857774922,"w":0.15777777671813964,"text":"if they hadn't read about it.","x":0.55111111027055981,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.43333332061767582,"y":0.81959183679806102,"text":"• The press should be free but journalists should be reported if they break","x":0.54888890246893962},{"text":"the law. Too many stories now are badly researched and contain incorrect","x":0.54888889639705396,"y":0.8342857143399014,"w":0.4311111068725586,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.55111112896675141,"y":0.8488372094498422,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"facts. If they were better written, more people 4would read \/ will read them!","w":0.43555553436279293},{"w":0.40666664123535146,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.54888890668787971,"y":0.86326530623095077,"text":"• Definitely not! The public wouldn't get to know many things if we"},{"w":0.42666664123535158,"y":0.87790697696310216,"x":0.55111112809343521,"text":"didn't have freedom of the press. 5Had we \/ We had not had it over the","h":0.010256288489516874},{"h":0.010371381020059411,"y":0.89224489781141214,"x":0.5488889018022729,"w":0.39333332061767579,"text":"years, many things would have been covered up from the public."},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"x":0.96666666690018954,"w":0.017777776718139626,"text":"\/5","y":0.9142441863755868},{"w":0.051111111640930185,"h":0.013081395674724994,"text":"Total","y":0.93313953478436706,"x":0.85777777719342385},{"y":0.93313953455725951,"text":"\/30","w":0.035555555820465101,"x":0.94444444414532303,"h":0.013081395674724994}]